  "title": "Adana kebab",
  "slug": "adana-kebab",
  "summary": "Adana kebab is a traditional Turkish minced lamb dish seasoned with red pepper paste and pul biber. The meat is typically shaped onto skewers or into köfte and grilled or baked until crispy.",
